{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23881","headline":"劝酒十四首 不如来饮酒七首 五 · 白居易","name":"劝酒十四首 不如来饮酒七首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫学长生去，仙方悞杀君。\n那将薤上露，拟待鹤边云。\n矻矻皆烧药，累累尽作坟。\n不如来饮酒，闲坐醉醺醺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23881.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23881","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}